# Gobo Directus extension

This repo is a **Directus interface extension** (`gobo-translations-grid`) for multi-column translations. Full guidance: `AGENTS.md`.

## Before coding

1. Read `AGENTS.md` for architecture, style, and PR conventions.
2. Use **user-directus** MCP (`collections`, `fields`, `schema`, `items`, `flows`, etc.) to inspect the live project—do not invent collection or field names.
3. Match existing patterns in this repo (TypeScript, ESM, Vue 3 for app extensions).

## Build & deploy

- `npm run build` / `npm run dev` (or pnpm equivalents per `package.json`)
- Ship `dist/` into the target Directus `extensions/` folder
- Prefer `@directus/extensions-sdk` composables (`useApi`, `useStores`, `useCollection`) in app code

## Style

- TypeScript, `const` over `let`, Vitest tests as `*.test.ts` beside source
- Minimal diffs; follow ESLint/Prettier when configured in this repo

## Scope

- Monorepo commands (`pnpm --filter @directus/api`), changesets, and blackbox tests apply only to **upstream Directus core**, not this extension unless explicitly working there.
